      "message": "I still don\u0027t understand why this patch is needed. Can you explain what case will be fixed exactly how? You\u0027re trying to fix a powered HDMI dongle after RO-\u003eRW jump in unlocked systems? How do you know it\u0027ll improve more than regress more?\n\nFYI: I\u0027m thinking of resetting all (or at least DP) alt. modes by disconnecting partners on every AP reset (s5-\u003es3). Some monitors don\u0027t deal with exit DP mode properly (legitimately because the DP spec doesn\u0027t require that).\n\nIt has a potential to fix several bugs, including yours, b/110441862, chromium:887731.",
